sr` | Where files will be installed (root filesystem) |\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib` | Libraries go in `/usr/lib` (not `/usr/lib64`) |\n| `-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=icx` | Use Intel's **C** compiler (`icx`) |\n| `-DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=icpx` | Use Intel's **C++** compiler (`icpx`) |\n| `-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER_LAUNCH"}